    "created_at": "2016-04-22T16:06:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-22T16:06:05Z",
    "body": "Reviewing the DOMTokenList spec, it looks like we decided not to try to enforce any invariants with regard to its contents. I remember arguing that we should try to do that but IIRC the fact that `.setAttribute()` would allow bypasses was enough to convince everyone we shouldn't bother.\n\nWe might want to extend the \"supported tokens\" concept though so that `aEl.ping.supports(\"blob:abc\")` is false? Meh.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
