    "updated_at": "2016-04-23T03:28:13Z",
    "body": "I think it's not worth the complexity for anything but simple tokens.\n\nFWIW, https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-location-protocol has \"http\" or \"https\" and Fetch has it too. I was thinking that maybe \"HTTP(S) scheme\" would be maximally clear, even though it looks a little weird.\n",
